{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24810","headline":"贡举人谒先师闻雅乐 · 王起","name":"贡举人谒先师闻雅乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼观光士，来同鹄鹭羣。\n鞠躬遗像在，稽首雅歌闻。\n度曲飘清汉，余音遏晓云。\n两楹凄已合，九仞杳难分。\n断续同清吹，洪纤入紫氛。\n长言听已罢，千载仰斯文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}